      sessionStorage key no longer matches WarningsKey, which changed
      with the content, confirmed via direct comparison of the stored key
      against the new key).
  (c) Warnings clearing entirely after a (second) dismissal (rebalanced
      patterns so no file is double-claimed): exactly 1 mutation; region
      ends at "" (empty), matching #accounts-warnings-data's now-empty
